  Client -> Client : backoff and open new socket generation
  Client -> WS : req connect mode resume
  WS -> Hub : atomic snapshot and cursor
  Hub --> WS : run_seq N, history_seq H, frozen model/thinking,\npartial message, open contents, active tools
  WS --> Client : res connect snapshot first
  Hub --> WS : events with run_seq greater than N
  WS --> Client : post-snapshot EventFrames may arrive
  Client -> Reducer : validate connection seq and buffer
  Client -> WS : req chat.history(run_id, through H)
  WS -> History : read prior run messages and tool results
  History --> WS : history through watermark
